{
  "title": "Hearty Velvety Kenyan Passion Fruit Curry",
  "description": "A kid-friendly Kenyan dish featuring passion fruit pulp, yuzu-cure, and ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly ingredients, this curry is resinous and velvety in texture.",
